<title>UK: Close Bros jumps to new peak after results.</title>
<headline>Close Bros jumps to new peak after results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close Brothers Group Plc jumped to a record peak on Monday after the company posted better-than-expected results, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1159 GMT, the shares were up 9p to 390p, one penny off the record set earlier.  </p>
<p>It was the sixth consecutive session in which the shares have risen.</p>
